Lady Lindbergh, we should go now.

153
00:13:20,380 --> 00:13:21,840
We are of no use here.

154
00:13:24,440 --> 00:13:28,797
I agree let's go back and meet up with
my brother what do you think instructor?

155
00:13:28,880 --> 00:13:34,077
Given the situation Do you need
to ask there's really no choice

156
00:13:34,160 --> 00:13:37,537
but to get our butts out of
here yes I understand That was

157
00:13:37,620 --> 00:13:40,797
silly of me why is she smiling
you'd think she'd be more

